---
source: packages/tier2/regress/tests/ivreg.rs
expression: "all_of(&staff, false)"
---
## a strong instrument on staff
let staff = dataset(staff)
let iv = staff.ivreg(productivity ~ training, fe: site, instruments: training ~ offer)
iv.ar_test()
iv.ci(training)

---
ar_test · iv · training
  H0: the coefficient of training is zero          β = 0
  H1: the coefficient of training is not zero      β ≠ 0
F(1, 2,387) = 90.24   p < 0.001
decision at α = 0.05: reject H0 (p < 0.001)
95% confidence set for the coefficient of training: from 3.7492 to 5.4380
Anderson–Rubin test on the instrument offer; valid however weak the instruments
3.76049
5.44481

## a fit by reg has no such test
let staff = dataset(staff)
staff.reg(productivity ~ training).ar_test()

---
error[Z0401]: `ar_test` cannot be called on a RegFit
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:1
  |
2 | staff.reg(productivity ~ training).ar_test()
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this is a RegFit
  |
  = help: `ar_test` takes an IvFit first; `x.ar_test(...)` is `ar_test(x, ...)`

## a level that is not a probability
let staff = dataset(staff)
staff.ivreg(productivity ~ training, instruments: training ~ offer).ar_test(level: 95)

---
error[Z0401]: `level:` is a probability strictly between 0 and 1, but this is 95
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:84
  |
2 | staff.ivreg(productivity ~ training, instruments: training ~ offer).ar_test(level: 95)
  |                                                                                    ^^ not a confidence level
  |
  = help: the usual levels are 0.9, 0.95 and 0.99

## nothing left to instrument
let staff = dataset(staff).add(both = age + distance)
staff.ivreg(productivity ~ age + distance + both, instruments: both ~ offer).ar_test()

---
note: `both` is collinear with the columns before it and was dropped (line 2)
note: `both` was dropped, so nothing is instrumented and the estimates are those of least squares (line 2)
error[Z0802]: nothing is instrumented in this fit, so there is no coefficient for the Anderson–Rubin test
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:1
  |
2 | staff.ivreg(productivity ~ age + distance + both, instruments: both ~ offer).ar_test()
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a fit whose instrumented regressors were all dropped
  |
  = help: the fit dropped every instrumented regressor as collinear; its notes say which
